# public on `main` before this cleanup, so those ship (regenerated against the current checkpoint
# where relevant — see docs/PROJECT_ANALYSIS.md). feat_logfbank_nfilt40 test features and
# website/ recordings were never exposed, so those stay out to avoid *new* exposure.
